@startuml
title 行の token は止まり、高水位は上がるだけ
hide time-axis
scale 1 as 170 pixels

concise "書き込みイベント" as EV
robust "高水位 (プロセスで 1 つ)" as HW
robust "design の行の token" as D
robust "roadmap の行の token" as R

@0
EV is "起動 WriteSchema→r2"
HW is r2
D is 空
R is 空

@1
EV is "roadmap 作成→r3"
R is r3
HW is r3

@2
EV is "design 共有→r5"
D is r5
HW is r5

@3
EV is "design 剥奪→r6"
D is r6
HW is r6

@4
EV is {hidden}
@enduml
